<topic id = "AENLSB0A1416042003" page = "2">
<title>
Valve stem end deflection
</title>
<ptxt>
If bore gauge is not available, check end deflection of valve stem with a dial gauge instead.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Move valve stem end in directions (1) and (2) to measure end deflection.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If deflection exceeds its limit, replace valve and valve guide.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Valve stem end deflection limit
</title>
<ptxt>
In: 0.14 mm (0.0055 in.)
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Ex: 0.18 mm (0.0071 in.)
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B141104.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.000mm" ver = "01" gw = "137" gh = "128"/>
</figure>
</spec>
</topic>
