<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1416042004" page = "2">
<title>
Valve
</title>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A1416042005">
<title>
Visual inspection
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Remove all carbon deposits from valve (1).
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check each valve for wear, burn or distortion at its face and valve stem and, if necessary, replace it.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Measure valve protrusion “a”.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If measured length is out of standard range, replace valve.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Valve protrusion “a”
</title>
<ptxt>
Standard
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
IN: 40.52 – 41.12 mm (1.614 – 1.619 in.)
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
EX: 40.42 – 41.02 mm (1.591 – 1.615 in.)
</ptxt>
