<s1>
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
Valve lapping:
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Lap valve on seat in two steps, first with coarse size lapping compound applied to face and the second with fine-size compound, each time using valve lapper according to usual lapping method.
</ptxt>
